Job Opportunity: GRC Security Analyst (Hybrid)
Location: Lansing, MI (Local Candidates Only – Within 90 Miles)
Duration: 12 Months
Work Mode: Hybrid – Onsite 2 Days/Week (Starting Day 1)

Interview: Virtual First Round | Potential In-Person Second Round

Job Description
We are seeking an experienced GRC Security Analyst to support security governance, risk management, and compliance initiatives. The candidate will manage System Security Plans (SSPs), coordinate Authority to Operate (ATO) renewals, oversee security controls, and ensure compliance with NIST and State of Michigan standards.

Key Responsibilities
Manage and maintain System Security Plans (SSPs) and ATO renewals.
Ensure compliance with NIST standards and security controls.
Manage POA&Ms, risk assessments, and audit documentation.
Coordinate with technical teams, business stakeholders, auditors, and vendors.
Identify compliance gaps and recommend corrective actions.
Support security incident response, detection, and recovery.
Prepare management reports and compliance metrics.

Important: Local candidates only. Candidates must be within 90 miles of Lansing, MI and available for potential in-person interviews.

